{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "title": "Fixture: prose only",
    "slug": "fixture-simple",
    "date": "2026-10-08",
    "summary": "The baseline document. One prose band, every block kind and every allowed mark, no canvas at all."
  },
  "bands": [
    {
      "id": "b_simple_prose",
      "type": "prose",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p_open",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            { "type": "text", "text": "I started coding this year, and " },
            { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }], "text": "Track" },
            { "type": "text", "text": " is one of the first things I built for myself instead of as a tutorial exercise. I wanted a habit tracker that felt good on the days I showed up and " },
            { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "italic" }], "text": "did not make me feel like garbage" },
            { "type": "text", "text": " on the days I did not." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "h2_heatmap",
          "kind": "h2",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Why a heatmap" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_heatmap",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            { "type": "text", "text": "The whole app is inspired by the contribution grid: a square fills in, and a month of showing up turns into a shape you can read at a glance. You can " },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://habit-tracker-xi-gilt.vercel.app/welcome",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "rel": "noopener noreferrer"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "text": "try the live version"
            },
            { "type": "text", "text": " if you want to see it fill in." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "quote_motive",
          "kind": "quote",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                { "type": "text", "text": "Most habit trackers run on streaks and guilt. I wanted the opposite: something that quietly rewards consistency and forgives the gaps." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_cover",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            { "type": "text", "text": "The part I love is that " },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "textStyle", "attrs": { "color": "#ff5722" } }],
              "text": "you build your own cover"
            },
            { "type": "text", "text": ". You choose whatever images get you fired up, and you see them every time you open the app." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "h3_detail",
          "kind": "h3",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What I actually track" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "ul_habits",
          "kind": "ul",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Drinking enough water" }] }]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Getting the steps in" }] }]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Taking the daily vitamins" }] }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ol_steps",
          "kind": "ol",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Open the app on today" }] }]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Tap the row, watch the square light up" }] }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_close",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            { "type": "text", "text": "After all, it is just a cover. But opening the app to something that moves you does more for consistency than a push notification ever has." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
